---@field horizontalScrollPercentageList? gcp.tagmanager_v2.Parameter List of integer percentage values for scroll triggers. The trigger will fire when each percentage is reached when the view is scrolled horizontally. Only valid for AMP scroll triggers.
---@field parameter? gcp.tagmanager_v2.ParameterList Additional parameters.
---@field visiblePercentageMin? gcp.tagmanager_v2.Parameter A visibility trigger minimum percent visibility. Only valid for AMP Visibility trigger.
---@field customEventFilter? gcp.tagmanager_v2.ConditionList Used in the case of custom event, which is fired iff all Conditions are true.
---@field totalTimeMinMilliseconds? gcp.tagmanager_v2.Parameter A visibility trigger minimum total visible time (in milliseconds). Only valid for AMP Visibility trigger.
---@field intervalSeconds? gcp.tagmanager_v2.Parameter Time between Timer Events to fire (in seconds). Only valid for AMP Timer trigger.
---@field maxTimerLengthSeconds? gcp.tagmanager_v2.Parameter Max time to fire Timer Events (in seconds). Only valid for AMP Timer trigger.
