---Represents a Google Tag Manager Trigger
---@class gcp.tagmanager_v2.Trigger
---@field fingerprint? string The fingerprint of the GTM Trigger as computed at storage time. This value is recomputed whenever the trigger is modified.
---@field tagManagerUrl? string Auto generated link to the tag manager UI
---@field eventName? gcp.tagmanager_v2.Parameter Name of the GTM event that is fired. Only valid for Timer triggers.
---@field visibilitySelector? gcp.tagmanager_v2.Parameter A visibility trigger CSS selector (i.e. "#id"). Only valid for AMP Visibility trigger.
---@field verticalScrollPercentageList? gcp.tagmanager_v2.Parameter List of integer percentage values for scroll triggers. The trigger will fire when each percentage is reached when the view is scrolled vertically. Only valid for AMP scroll triggers.
---@field path? string GTM Trigger's API relative path.
---@field filter? gcp.tagmanager_v2.ConditionList The trigger will only fire iff all Conditions are true.
---@field limit? gcp.tagmanager_v2.Parameter Limit of the number of GTM events this Timer Trigger will fire. If no limit is set, we will continue to fire GTM events until the user leaves the page. Only valid for Timer triggers.
---@field type? gcp.tagmanager_v2.TriggerTypeEnum|string Defines the data layer event that causes this trigger.
---@field containerId? string GTM Container ID.
---@field waitForTagsTimeout? gcp.tagmanager_v2.Parameter How long to wait (in milliseconds) for tags to fire when 'waits_for_tags' above evaluates to true. Only valid for Form Submission and Link Click triggers.
---@field notes? string User notes on how to apply this trigger in the container.
---@field selector? gcp.tagmanager_v2.Parameter A click trigger CSS selector (i.e. "a", "button" etc.). Only valid for AMP Click trigger.
---@field accountId? string GTM Account ID.
---@field parentFolderId? string Parent folder id.
---@field waitForTags? gcp.tagmanager_v2.Parameter Whether or not we should delay the form submissions or link opening until all of the tags have fired (by preventing the default action and later simulating the default action). Only valid for Form Submission and Link Click triggers.
---@field interval? gcp.tagmanager_v2.Parameter Time between triggering recurring Timer Events (in milliseconds). Only valid for Timer triggers.
---@field continuousTimeMinMilliseconds? gcp.tagmanager_v2.Parameter A visibility trigger minimum continuous visible time (in milliseconds). Only valid for AMP Visibility trigger.
